Additive patch for archimatetool/archi's top-level pom.xml (Tycho
target-platform-configuration): adds a 5th <environment> for
linux/gtk/aarch64 alongside the existing 4 (win32/x86_64, linux/gtk/x86_64,
macosx/cocoa/x86_64, macosx/cocoa/aarch64) — does not remove or reorder any
of the originals. See CLAUDE.md §5, §15.10, §16 for background: the Eclipse
p2 repo already ships SWT fragments for this target, upstream just never
requests it via this list.

Apply from the root of an `archimatetool/archi` checkout (matching
ARCHI_VERSION's `release_<version>` tag), e.g.:
  patch -p1 < archi-pom-add-linux-gtk-aarch64.patch

--- a/pom.xml
+++ b/pom.xml
@@ -135,6 +135,11 @@
                             <ws>cocoa</ws>
                             <arch>aarch64</arch>
                         </environment>
+                        <environment>
+                            <os>linux</os>
+                            <ws>gtk</ws>
+                            <arch>aarch64</arch>
+                        </environment>
                     </environments>
                 </configuration>
             </plugin>
